{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hant",
  "language_raw": "Trad_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/class_f_05.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/class_f_05.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_01",
      "hash64": "5A9FE3AEC3AD22D0",
      "text": "小生是八朔，請多指教是也。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_02",
      "hash64": "5A9FE6AEC3AD27E9",
      "text": "期中考的結果，\\n全班都表現得很傑出呢。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_03",
      "hash64": "5A9FE5AEC3AD2636",
      "text": "為了努力作答的各位同學，\\n小生邀請了特別來賓。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_04",
      "hash64": "5A9FE8AEC3AD2B4F",
      "text": "阿寇，請進吧。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_01",
      "hash64": "68E2B514A1C72785",
      "text": "打擾了！[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_02",
      "hash64": "68E2B214A1C7226C",
      "text": "我叫寇沙，\\n是專精草寶可夢的藝術家！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_05",
      "hash64": "5A9FE7AEC3AD299C",
      "text": "這位是寇沙，他的創作\\n是以雕刻等立體作品為主。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_06",
      "hash64": "5A9FEAAEC3AD2EB5",
      "text": "著名的代表作是深缽鎮的\\n「隨他去之向日花怪」。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_07",
      "hash64": "5A9FE9AEC3AD2D02",
      "text": "已經挑戰過深缽道館的同學裡，\\n應該有不少人見過吧。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_03",
      "hash64": "68E2B314A1C7241F",
      "text": "這裡的確有幾個熟面孔。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_04",
      "hash64": "68E2B014A1C71F06",
      "text": "能夠選修阿朔的美術課，\\n在場的諸位非常幸運。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_05",
      "hash64": "68E2B114A1C720B9",
      "text": "阿朔他曾在我對人生絕望，\\n自暴自棄時……[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_06",
      "hash64": "68E2AE14A1C71BA0",
      "text": "挺身拯救了我。\\n乃是我的人生導師！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_07",
      "hash64": "68E2AF14A1C71D53",
      "text": "我能夠樹立今天的藝術風格，\\n都是因為有阿朔……！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_08",
      "hash64": "5A9FECAEC3AD321B",
      "text": "阿寇……！[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_09",
      "hash64": "5A9FEBAEC3AD3068",
      "text": "雖然分享往事也很好，但今天\\n請講一堂有你的特色的課吧。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_08",
      "hash64": "68E2BC14A1C7336A",
      "text": "包在我身上！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_09",
      "hash64": "68E2BD14A1C7351D",
      "text": "讓我想想……剛才阿朔\\n提到的「隨他去之向日花怪」。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_10",
      "hash64": "68E63A14A1CA3F5B",
      "text": "我是用什麼樣的心情\\n作出了向日花怪那達觀的表情……\\r\\n有誰知道嗎！？[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_f_05_select_01",
      "hash64": "1738F3B775F84FC1",
      "text": "幸福的心情",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_f_05_select_02",
      "hash64": "1738F0B775F84AA8",
      "text": "悲傷的心情",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_f_05_select_03",
      "hash64": "1738F1B775F84C5B",
      "text": "憤怒的心情",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_11",
      "hash64": "68E63914A1CA3DA8",
      "text": "徹徹底底的不對！\\n……全都不對！！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_12",
      "hash64": "68E63C14A1CA42C1",
      "text": "製作那個作品時，\\n我處於心灰意冷的境界！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_13",
      "hash64": "68E63B14A1CA410E",
      "text": "心想著要是這個作品無法獲得好評，\\n我就要卸下藝術家的身分……\\r\\n我那時幾乎是已經死了半條心了！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_10",
      "hash64": "5A9C7EAEC3AA415A",
      "text": "所以才會叫做\\n「隨他去之向日花怪」啊。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_14",
      "hash64": "68E63E14A1CA4627",
      "text": "正是如此，阿朔！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_15",
      "hash64": "68E63D14A1CA4474",
      "text": "當我還是個剛起步的藝術家時，\\n我不僅生了大病，還陷入低潮，\\r\\n因此內心非常焦急。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_16",
      "hash64": "68E64014A1CA498D",
      "text": "當時的我只在乎錢和評價，\\n想著到底該製作什麼才能賣出去……[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_17",
      "hash64": "68E63F14A1CA47DA",
      "text": "這樣誕生的作品\\n盡都是些膚淺的爛東西！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_18",
      "hash64": "68E63214A1CA31C3",
      "text": "在那樣的時候遇見了阿朔，\\n發現自己的渺小……\\r\\n總之，就是想通了很多東西！！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_19",
      "hash64": "68E63114A1CA3010",
      "text": "……那個向日花怪，\\n就是這樣完成的。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_11",
      "hash64": "5A9C7FAEC3AA430D",
      "text": "想不到……\\n小生我也是今天才知道。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_20",
      "hash64": "68DBA814A1C0F2C0",
      "text": "就是因為感情好，\\n所以才難以說出口啊。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_21",
      "hash64": "68DBA914A1C0F473",
      "text": "總而言之，你們這些青春期的\\n小蘿蔔頭們想必有很多煩惱。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_22",
      "hash64": "68DBAA14A1C0F626",
      "text": "但是只要對自己誠實，\\n自由地去做想做的事就好了。\\r\\n……在不給別人帶來困擾的前提下。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
